","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"依此原句與所屬發話／敘事主語承接辨識；不是最近人名通則。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit006:m0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"臣松之","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與固定平行語境辨識；原稱保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit006:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"秦客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未決指稱；不以最近人物、同姓或同名強配。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit006:m0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"范燮","kind":"person","person_id":"cno_x3i_mx4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"裴松之明言對秦客者范燮；此為古注的名指，不是靜默改本傳范匄。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit006:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"范匄","kind":"person","person_id":"23d_95b_500","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"此云范匄盖誤是裴松之校舉本傳收到名字，而非又稱故事答秦客者為匄；此一被校舉名按字面連既存士匄，故事角色首選燮另案保存，不把literal提及當士匄參與此事的史實。"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-027","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-027-wangchang"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p119","text":"六年，魯襄公朝晉。晉欒逞有罪，奔齊。八年，齊莊公微遣欒逞於曲沃，以兵隨之。齊兵上太行，欒逞從曲沃中反，襲入絳。絳不戒，平公欲自殺，范獻子止公，以其徒撃逞，逞敗走曲沃。曲沃攻逞，逞死，遂滅欒氏宗。逞者，欒書孫也。其入絳，與魏氏謀。齊莊公聞逞敗，乃還，取晉之朝歌去，以報臨菑之役也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"魯襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"范獻子","kind":"person","person_id":"23d_95b_500","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"欒盈入絳同事件，左傳范宣子奉公入固宮而命其子鞅出擊，首選士匄；史記范獻子原字不改，角色同指屬可撤回編者判斷。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0093","start":93,"end":96,"surface":"欒氏宗","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"欒書","kind":"person","person_id":"c8b_f8t_ylf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"魏氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0114","start":114,"end":117,"surface":"齊莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"fm3_f8m_0vr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-035-cuihao:p010","text":"㑹聞劉裕死太宗欲取洛陽虎牢滑臺浩曰陛下不以劉裕欻起納其使貢裕亦敬事陛下不幸今死乘喪伐之雖得之不令春秋晉士匄帥師侵齊聞齊侯卒乃還君子犬其不伐喪以為恩足以感孝子義足以動諸侯今國家亦未能一舉而定江南宜遣人弔祭存其孤弱恤其凶災布義風於天下令徳之事也若此則化被荆揚南金象齒羽毛之珍可不求而自至裕新死黨與未離兵臨其境必相率拒戰功不可必不如緩之待其惡稔如其彊臣爭權變難必起然後命將揚威可不勞士卒而收淮北之地太宗鋭意南伐詰浩曰劉裕因姚興死而滅其國裕死我伐之何為不可浩固執曰興死二子交爭裕乃伐之太宗大怒不從浩言遂遣奚斤南伐議於監國之前曰先攻城也先略地也斤曰請先攻城浩曰南人長於守城苻氏攻襄陽經年不拔今以大國之力攻其小城若不時剋挫損軍勢敵得徐嚴而來我怠彼鋭危道也不如分軍略地至淮為限列置守宰收歛租榖滑臺虎牢反在軍北絶望南救必沿河東走若或不然即是囿中之物公孫表請先圖其城斤等濟河先攻滑臺經時不拔表請濟師太宗怒乃親南廵拜浩相州刺史加左光禄大夫隨軍為謀主及車駕之還也浩從太宗幸西河太原登憇髙陵之上下臨河流傍覽川域慨然有感遂與同寮論五等郡縣之是非考秦始皇漢武帝之違失好古識治時伏其言","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"first_line":173,"last_line":198,"revision_id":"17b6525eb5aaa878b9640f5a61e90da934ce5fc4","source_layer":"received_biography","projection_sha256":"439de84f4ff9277dcb57bb3ce19b4e89802788375ba56539bf1d09b929c4aac3","raw_character_positions":[{"line":173,"column":5},{"line":173,"column":6},{"line":173,"column":7},{"line":173,"column":8},{"line":173,"column":9},{"line":173,"column":10},{"line":173,"column":11},{"line":173,"column":12},{"line":173,"column":13},{"line":173,"column":14},{"line":173,"column":15},{"line":173,"column":16},{"line":173,"column":17},{"line":173,"column":18},{"line":173,"column":19},{"line":173,"column":20},{"line":174,"column":0},{"line":174,"column":1},{"line":174,"column":2},{"line":174,"column":3},{"line":174,"column":4},{"line":174,"column":5},{"line":174,"column":6},{"line":174,"column":7},{"line":174,"column":8},{"line":174,"column":9},{"line":174,"column":10},{"line":174,"column":11},{"line":174,"column":12},{"line":174,"column":13},{"line":174,"column":14},{"line":174,"column":15},{"line":174,"column":16},{"line":174,"column":17},{"line":174,"column":18},{"line":174,"column":19},{"line":174,"column":20},{"line":175,"column":0},{"line":175,"column":1},{"line":175,"column":2},{"line":175,"column